      "note": "Institutional accountability uses legal and regulatory mechanisms, not market forces."
    },
    {
      "term": "accountability_algorithmic",
      "note": "Algorithmic accountability audits specific systems; market accountability operates at the firm level."
    }
  ],
  "contested_aspects": [
    "Whether market forces are sufficient for AI accountability (Safetyists and Skeptics argue not)",
